Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":261,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":17275,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1860478,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1405615866,"LastPoster":{"Id":282709,"Name":"Jc14","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1878923,"PostDate":1416659355,"PostContent":"Picked up the bridesmaids dresses last weekend! \u00a0I was so nervous because we couldn't find what t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6683434621e5d737ab7d4baed478bf5b","RawContent":"Hey ladies, I&#039;m also getting married at the GPPC.. We are staying on the palace side of the resort!  Our date is Jan 10, 2015 and we have 56 people booked!  Do you ladies know if the WC will barter.. We are doing a DW to save on the costs but it&#039;s adding up quickly.  A friend of mine was married in Cuba and threatened to take her reception off the resort and they did it for free... Has anyone heard of anything like that at the GPPC?","Attachments":[],"Id":1872271,"PostDate":1411070866,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies, I'm also getting married at the GPPC.. We are staying on the palace side of the resort!  Our date is Jan 10, 2015 and we have 56 people booked!  Do you ladies know if the WC will barter.. We are doing a DW to save on the costs but it's adding up quickly.  A friend of mine was married in Cuba and threatened to take her reception off the resort and they did it for free... Has anyone heard of anything like that at the GPPC?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa_shallow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411070407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279896.jpg?_r=1422196653","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mels84","Id":279896,"Name":"Mels84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.48.194.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9ed3bdbded50fae3f306bfb07b43c02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Mels84\"]! &amp;nbsp;Congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So far I haven&#039;t had any luck with bartering... but we&#039;re looking at some options for cutting costs. &amp;nbsp;I thought the flowers were a little extreme (especially for bridesmaids and mothers), so we decided to order silk flowers here so at least we&#039;re saving that way. &amp;nbsp;Have you found any other tips for narrowing it down?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1872272,"PostDate":1411071289,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279896-mels84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mels84<\/span><\/a>! \u00a0Congrats!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So far I haven't had any luck with bartering... but we're looking at some options for cutting costs. \u00a0I thought the flowers were a little extreme (especially for bridesmaids and mothers), so we decided to order silk flowers here so at least we're saving that way. \u00a0Have you found any other tips for narrowing it down?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cf0944b2fc4da72ec89332e8b1233e9","RawContent":"@[member=\"Kerrierf\"] nothing really yet at the resort.  For wedding party clothes I&#039;m shopping now to get end of season deals.  I got the bridesmaid dresses from jjshouse.com.  Way cheaper than a bridal boutique and way faster.  They were in a week and a half after order $110\/dress.  I booked our hair appts at the spa in advance to get the online discount.  Our friend is a professional photographer so she is coming and I have a friend who is a makeup artist.  My dress is from a second hand bridal boutique.  It&#039;s a dress that&#039;s never been worn or altered.. Brand new .. Cost me $350!! We got my moms dress from there too for $135.  I would have never thought to shop second hand but really.. For a dress you will wear once.. Why spend a fortune??   I am planning to contact Carolina in the next couple of days to actually speak to her.  I will see if I can barter at all.  Another suggestion my friend had was to book the disco before it opens.. She did that for $300 at her resort in Cuba ... I priced the beach bash and for us it will be around $2300. IMO that&#039;s crazy for 2hrs!!  I&#039;m a bargain hunter.. I&#039;m sure I can find a cheaper way ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1872280,"PostDate":1411073687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276456\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276456-kerrierf\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kerrierf<\/span><\/a> nothing really yet at the resort.  For wedding party clothes I'm shopping now to get end of season deals.  I got the bridesmaid dresses from jjshouse.com.  Way cheaper than a bridal boutique and way faster.  They were in a week and a half after order $110\/dress.  I booked our hair appts at the spa in advance to get the online discount.  Our friend is a professional photographer so she is coming and I have a friend who is a makeup artist.  My dress is from a second hand bridal boutique.  It's a dress that's never been worn or altered.. Brand new .. Cost me $350!! We got my moms dress from there too for $135.  I would have never thought to shop second hand but really.. For a dress you will wear once.. Why spend a fortune??   I am planning to contact Carolina in the next couple of days to actually speak to her.  I will see if I can barter at all.  Another suggestion my friend had was to book the disco before it opens.. She did that for $300 at her resort in Cuba ... I priced the beach bash and for us it will be around $2300. IMO that's crazy for 2hrs!!  I'm a bargain hunter.. I'm sure I can find a cheaper way <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa_shallow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411070407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279896.jpg?_r=1422196653","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mels84","Id":279896,"Name":"Mels84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.48.194.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96bb16f3c34c334f1ecd5d60044e845a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! &amp;nbsp;Great job&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Mels84\"]! &amp;nbsp;Keep me posted on your wedding planning - it&#039;s so exciting to hear from other brides getting married at the same resort!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re just waiting for our guests to book their trips right now. &amp;nbsp;We should know our numbers by next week, so we&#039;ll be able to make more decisions then.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For discounts for us, we&#039;re also choosing our rings early, but ordering them during the \"boxing week sales\" - it&#039;s a great little way that we&#039;re able to save an extra couple of hundred dollars!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873531,"PostDate":1411815204,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! \u00a0Great job\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279896-mels84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mels84<\/span><\/a>! \u00a0Keep me posted on your wedding planning - it's so exciting to hear from other brides getting married at the same resort!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're just waiting for our guests to book their trips right now. \u00a0We should know our numbers by next week, so we'll be able to make more decisions then.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For discounts for us, we're also choosing our rings early, but ordering them during the \"boxing week sales\" - it's a great little way that we're able to save an extra couple of hundred dollars!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.201.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"09e58d1231eb78b419f5436fb2871b4c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Booked hair and makeup for myself and the bridesmaid this week, and we got our flowers (the silk ones we ordered, they look AMAZING)! Yahoo! &amp;nbsp;How&#039;s planning going for you ladies?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875939,"PostDate":1413494216,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Booked hair and makeup for myself and the bridesmaid this week, and we got our flowers (the silk ones we ordered, they look AMAZING)! Yahoo! \u00a0How's planning going for you ladies?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.95.129.224","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"831a97d9b0d18d99a3fdf1d67d89981a","RawContent":"@[member=\"Kerrierf\"] That&#039;s awesome!! where did you get your flowers?  Were they cheaper than the ones at the resort??  I&#039;m trying to find silk flowers too but finding them more than the real ones at the resort.  I did make my own corsages for the moms and the boutonni\u00e8res for the guys! Pics posted. I just emailed Carolina today with a pile of questions.  I&#039;ll post the questions with the responses when she gets back to me :).","Attachments":[{"Id":29810,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2014\/post-279896-0-04181200-1413510980.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2014\/post-279896-0-04181200-1413510980_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750},{"Id":29811,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2014\/post-279896-0-68834300-1413511071.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2014\/post-279896-0-68834300-1413511071_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":750}],"Id":1875941,"PostDate":1413496728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276456\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276456-kerrierf\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kerrierf<\/span><\/a> That's awesome!! where did you get your flowers?  Were they cheaper than the ones at the resort??  I'm trying to find silk flowers too but finding them more than the real ones at the resort.  I did make my own corsages for the moms and the boutonni\u00e8res for the guys! Pics posted. I just emailed Carolina today with a pile of questions.  I'll post the questions with the responses when she gets back to me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa_shallow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411070407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279896.jpg?_r=1422196653","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mels84","Id":279896,"Name":"Mels84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.201.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"776e3cfecb4759769532d90b29188954","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh wow! Those are amazing!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We got them from wedideas on etsy. &amp;nbsp;They&#039;re amazing, they actually feel real.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/img1.etsystatic.com\/043\/0\/51454705\/icm_fullxfull.44199917_qfua0ka77pcwoww40g8o.jpg&#039;&gt;https:\/\/img1.etsystatic.com\/043\/0\/51454705\/icm_fullxfull.44199917_qfua0ka77pcwoww40g8o.jpg&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249);\"&gt;1 Bride: As Shown in Listing. Light Yellow Wrap. $125&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249);\"&gt;1 MoH Bouquet: 7\" Wide Matching Bride. $55.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249);\"&gt;2 Bridesmaids: 6\" Wide Matchin Bride. $45.&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249);\"&gt;3 Boutonnieres: Calla Lily with Grass Sprays and Ribbon Wrap. $8 each.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249);\"&gt;2 Wrist Corsages: Matching Order. $12 each.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249);\"&gt;1 FREE Toss Bouquet&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;Oops, the wrist corsages were 14, not 12 :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875944,"PostDate":1413498752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh wow! Those are amazing!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We got them from wedideas on etsy. \u00a0They're amazing, they actually feel real.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/img1.etsystatic.com\/043\/0\/51454705\/icm_fullxfull.44199917_qfua0ka77pcwoww40g8o.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/img1.etsysta...pcwoww40g8o.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249)\">1 Bride: As Shown in Listing. Light Yellow Wrap. $125<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249)\">1 MoH Bouquet: 7\" Wide Matching Bride. $55.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249)\">2 Bridesmaids: 6\" Wide Matchin Bride. $45.<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249)\">3 Boutonnieres: Calla Lily with Grass Sprays and Ribbon Wrap. $8 each.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249)\">2 Wrist Corsages: Matching Order. $12 each.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;background-color:rgb(235,246,249)\">1 FREE Toss Bouquet<\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p>Oops, the wrist corsages were 14, not 12 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.201.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b05b21dc2ee43d9b250c5c94525b401","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Picked up the bridesmaids dresses last weekend! &amp;nbsp;I was so nervous because we couldn&#039;t find what they would look like in the yellow when we ordered them - but they turned out amazing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878923,"PostDate":1416659355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Picked up the bridesmaids dresses last weekend! \u00a0I was so nervous because we couldn't find what they would look like in the yellow when we ordered them - but they turned out amazing!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.71.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7693b1c21c2b2156430ba78de980e2dc","RawContent":"That&#039;s great news!   Where did you end up getting them from?? \n\n\nOur wedding is only 49 days away!!  Getting so excited!  I&#039;m finalizing our oot bags.  My dress is being altered... Things are coming together!!  Carolina sent me the final checklist so I&#039;m working on that... Still lots to do but I think its mostly minor things... I hope lol...\n\n\nI ended up deciding to make our bouquets.. So we are working on them this weekend... Bachelorette party is 2 wks away :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1878928,"PostDate":1416661713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That's great news!   Where did you end up getting them from?? <br><br>\nOur wedding is only 49 days away!!  Getting so excited!  I'm finalizing our oot bags.  My dress is being altered... Things are coming together!!  Carolina sent me the final checklist so I'm working on that... Still lots to do but I think its mostly minor things... I hope lol...<br><br>\nI ended up deciding to make our bouquets.. So we are working on them this weekend... Bachelorette party is 2 wks away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa_shallow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.100.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411070407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279896.jpg?_r=1422196653","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mels84","Id":279896,"Name":"Mels84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"135.23.201.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77556,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5099c0b0aef5b0460c67a869efc6b083","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mels84\"] that&#039;s amazing - so exciting! I can&#039;t wait to hear about your wedding when you get back.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What&#039;re you doing for your oot bags? &amp;nbsp;Is the final checklist different from the general excel spreadsheet document?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878929,"PostDate":1416661859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279896\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279896-mels84\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mels84<\/span><\/a> that's amazing - so exciting! I can't wait to hear about your wedding when you get back.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What're you doing for your oot bags? \u00a0Is the final checklist different from the general excel spreadsheet document?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kerrierf@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.165.209.118","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391380823,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276456.jpg?_r=1410147109","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kerrierf","Id":276456,"Name":"Kerrierf","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77556","Title":"2015 Grand Palladium Punta Cana Brides","LastPostDate":1437694241},"Pages":{"TotalItems":261,"TotalPages":27,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":260},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
