Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":19,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":6000,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1704988,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":264156,"Name":"KellyLBauman","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264156.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":112,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1358084457,"LastPoster":{"Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":22,"Preview":{"Id":1704988,"PostDate":1358084457,"PostContent":"Hello! I'm new to the board  I'm getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Re...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellylmorrison@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357747492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264156.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":112,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KellyLBauman","Id":264156,"Name":"KellyLBauman","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b13fae9ce973de4e05341b17dd0c921","RawContent":"Hello! I&#039;m new to the board :) I&#039;m getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I&#039;d like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I&#039;d like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I&#039;ll need someone to to an updo after a bit ;) I&#039;ve already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I&#039;m desperate!!! Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1704988,"PostDate":1358084457,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello! I'm new to the board <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I'd like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I'd like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I'll need someone to to an updo after a bit <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> I've already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I'm desperate!!! Lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kellylmorrison@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357747492,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264156.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":112,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KellyLBauman","Id":264156,"Name":"KellyLBauman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d98cce698fa3b98926f89306698011f3","RawContent":"Hi there. Are you looking for a hairstylist and makeup artist from DR? Or are you thinking to bring someone with you for that service?","Attachments":[],"Id":1709787,"PostDate":1358877619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi there. Are you looking for a hairstylist and makeup artist from DR? Or are you thinking to bring someone with you for that service?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberine_sheikh@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358853394,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264861.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NEandLovingIt","Id":264861,"Name":"NEandLovingIt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e1ab418b66f5cad92877d59ec67b95e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; HI NEandLovingIt,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The two names I found that do makeup\/hair in the punta cana are:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;- Krist Ann - &lt;\/strong&gt;(She didn&#039;t give me quote because she will not be in the Punta Cana area in July 2013)&amp;nbsp;her website\/facebook page is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; http:\/\/www.krystieann.com (She didn&#039;t give me quote because she will not be in the Punta Cana area in July 2013)&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Krystieannmakeup?fref=ts&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;- Indira Sanchez -&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;her website\/facebook page is:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; http:\/\/www.indiramua.blogspot.com&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have quotes if you want them PM me! I&#039;ve decided I&#039;m just going to with the spa at my resort. Indira&#039;s quotes came out to be a little over my budget and I would have to pay another vendor fee which I&#039;m trying to avoid because I have enough already. I heard the spa do a great job and my bridal party is pretty big so I&#039;m going to try and push for them to get us ready in my suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1711031,"PostDate":1359070572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> HI NEandLovingIt,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The two names I found that do makeup\/hair in the punta cana are:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>- Krist Ann - <\/strong>(She didn't give me quote because she will not be in the Punta Cana area in July 2013)\u00a0her website\/facebook page is:\u00a0<\/p> <ul> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.krystieann.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.krystieann.com<\/a> (She didn't give me quote because she will not be in the Punta Cana area in July 2013)<\/li> <li> <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/Krystieannmakeup?fref=ts' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook...nmakeup?fref=ts<\/a><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>- Indira Sanchez -<\/strong>\u00a0her website\/facebook page is:<\/p> <ul> <li> <a href='http:\/\/www.indiramua.blogspot.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.indiramua.blogspot.com<\/a><\/li> <li> <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua<\/a><\/li> <\/ul> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have quotes if you want them PM me! I've decided I'm just going to with the spa at my resort. Indira's quotes came out to be a little over my budget and I would have to pay another vendor fee which I'm trying to avoid because I have enough already. I heard the spa do a great job and my bridal party is pretty big so I'm going to try and push for them to get us ready in my suite.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ejm.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.15.209.120","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315616972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245130.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EJM17","Id":245130,"Name":"EJM17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ec7735c6e9e11be1ab8aa6220898416","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Kelly. how are you ? I am a profetional hair and make up stylist here in bavaro,,,I am russian and reside in bavaro punta cana for the last 2 years ....It would be my pleasure to work with you on your wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tel: 809-961-5935&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Email:cao123@hotmail.com&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This is the first time that I use this website,..so I dont know how to use it very good.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you send me your Email address I can send you some pics&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;some works that I have made in australia.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Yulia Soler&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1712343,"PostDate":1359361310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Kelly. how are you ? I am a profetional hair and make up stylist here in bavaro,,,I am russian and reside in bavaro punta cana for the last 2 years ....It would be my pleasure to work with you on your wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Tel: 809-961-5935<\/p> <p> Email:cao123@hotmail.com<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This is the first time that I use this website,..so I dont know how to use it very good.<\/p> <p> If you send me your Email address I can send you some pics\u00a0of\u00a0some works that I have made in australia.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yulia Soler\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cao123@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359359486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265254.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"queens co","Id":265254,"Name":"queens co","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb848a713e45476f2129869be556b1e5","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KellyLBauman[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hello! I&#039;m new to the board :) I&#039;m getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I&#039;d like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I&#039;d like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I&#039;ll need someone to to an updo after a bit [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif[\/img] I&#039;ve already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I&#039;m desperate!!! Lol[\/quote] \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]NEandLovingIt[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hi there. Are you looking for a hairstylist and makeup artist from DR? Or are you thinking to bring someone with you for that service?[\/quote] \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KellyLBauman[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hello! I&#039;m new to the board :) I&#039;m getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I&#039;d like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I&#039;d like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I&#039;ll need someone to to an updo after a bit [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif[\/img] I&#039;ve already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I&#039;m desperate!!! Lol[\/quote] \n I am a professional hair and makeup stylist .....If Kelly wants  I can be on her wedding. \n \n Yulia \n \n Contact: 809-961-5935 \n Email: [email=\"cao123@hotmail.com\"]cao123@hotmail.com[\/email]","Attachments":[],"Id":1712353,"PostDate":1359363758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KellyLBauman<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello! I'm new to the board <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I'd like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I'd like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I'll need someone to to an updo after a bit <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"bbcode_smiley\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span> I've already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I'm desperate!!! Lol<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>NEandLovingIt<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hi there. Are you looking for a hairstylist and makeup artist from DR? Or are you thinking to bring someone with you for that service?<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KellyLBauman<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello! I'm new to the board <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I'd like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I'd like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I'll need someone to to an updo after a bit <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"bbcode_smiley\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span> I've already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I'm desperate!!! Lol<\/blockquote> <p> I am a professional hair and makeup stylist .....If Kelly wants\u00a0 I can be on her wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yulia<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Contact: 809-961-5935<\/p> <p> Email: <a href='mailto:cao123@hotmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>cao123@hotmail.com<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cao123@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359359486,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265254.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"queens co","Id":265254,"Name":"queens co","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02effad04b583221b8c8ad93c98ff817","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi! my name is Anna I am a bridal hairstylist, I live in NY but I am moving to DR soon, when is your wedding day?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I attached my website here :) let me know!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/annanuet.wix.com\/annanuethair&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713777,"PostDate":1359580949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi! my name is Anna I am a bridal hairstylist, I live in NY but I am moving to DR soon, when is your wedding day?\u00a0<\/p> <p> I attached my website here <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> let me know!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/annanuet.wix.com\/annanuethair' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/annanuet.wix.com\/annanuethair<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anna.nuet@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1359580395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"annahairstylis","Id":265410,"Name":"annahairstylis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6909c1902e8ad4cd8379a068957a0398","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi! my name is Anna I am a bridal hairstylist, I live in NY but I am planning to move to DR soon, when is your wedding day? I am confused if its on April or July.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is my website if you want to contact me :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/annanuet.wix.com\/annanuethair&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1713786,"PostDate":1359581298,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi! my name is Anna I am a bridal hairstylist, I live in NY but I am planning to move to DR soon, when is your wedding day? I am confused if its on April or July.<\/p> <p> Here is my website if you want to contact me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/annanuet.wix.com\/annanuethair' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/annanuet.wix.com\/annanuethair<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anna.nuet@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1359580395,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"annahairstylis","Id":265410,"Name":"annahairstylis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a91b8a714a35124055a898378644ceea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Were you able to find anyone?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1738896,"PostDate":1364343195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Were you able to find anyone?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"madeline152003@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.100.18.37","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1351202964,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261785.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mady28","Id":261785,"Name":"Mady28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32ff5c026dadd190678f1325aa668618","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey Mady!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have decided to just stick with my resort spa for hair and make up. But I do have a name of a very good make up artist in DR. She works in the capital but she does go to Punta Cana. Her name is Indira Sanchez - her email is&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; line-height: normal; white-space: nowrap; \"&gt;indiramua@gmail.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; line-height: normal; white-space: nowrap; \"&gt; and her facebook page is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; She was a bit out of my budget. She quoted me $200 for my make up and $100\/each for my bridesmaids. Hair was $75\/per person. I would have also had to pay my vendor fee of $150 for her to come in the resort. So I&#039;m just sticking with the spa. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742935,"PostDate":1365330265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Mady!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have decided to just stick with my resort spa for hair and make up. But I do have a name of a very good make up artist in DR. She works in the capital but she does go to Punta Cana. Her name is Indira Sanchez - her email is\u00a0<span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">indiramua@gmail.com<\/span><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"> and her facebook page is:\u00a0<\/span>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> She was a bit out of my budget. She quoted me $200 for my make up and $100\/each for my bridesmaids. Hair was $75\/per person. I would have also had to pay my vendor fee of $150 for her to come in the resort. So I'm just sticking with the spa. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ejm.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.15.209.120","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315616972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245130.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EJM17","Id":245130,"Name":"EJM17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71800,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e89d312948dc74fe023b9416ff89a776","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]KellyLBauman[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Hello! I&#039;m new to the board :) I&#039;m getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I&#039;d like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I&#039;d like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I&#039;ll need someone to to an updo after a bit [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif[\/img] I&#039;ve already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I&#039;m desperate!!! Lol[\/quote] \n [color=#181818][font=arial][background=rgb(253, 252, 250)]\n Hey Kelly![\/background][\/font][\/color] \n [color=#181818][font=arial][background=rgb(253, 252, 250)]\n I have decided to just stick with my resort spa for hair and make up. But I do have a name of a very good make up artist in DR. She works in the capital but she does go to Punta Cana. Her name is Indira Sanchez - her email is [font=arial]indiramua@gmail.com[\/font][font=arial]and her facebook page is: [\/font][url=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua\"]https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua[\/url][\/background][\/font][\/color] \n [color=#181818][font=arial][background=rgb(253, 252, 250)]\n She was a bit out of my budget. She quoted me $200 for my make up and $100\/each for my bridesmaids. Hair was $75\/per person. I would have also had to pay my vendor fee of $150 for her to come in the resort. So I&#039;m just sticking with the spa. :)[\/background][\/font][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1742937,"PostDate":1365330363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>KellyLBauman<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Hello! I'm new to the board <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm getting married at the Pardisus Palma Real and staying in The Reserve April 15th 2013. I'd like to hire a professional hair\/makeup artist that I could pay by the hour to stay with me for a few hours to touch up my hair and face as we take pictures. My finance and I are eloping alone, so,I want to go all out on the photographs. I'd like to wear my hair down for the ceremony... But given the heat, I'll need someone to to an updo after a bit <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"bbcode_smiley\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span> I've already contacted Krystie Ann and she has a wedding booked that day. Does anyone have any other contacts in that area??? Thank you, I'm desperate!!! Lol<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365344113297_966\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> Hey Kelly!<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365344113297_964\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365344113297_961\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> I have decided to just stick with my resort spa for hair and make up. But I do have a name of a very good make up artist in DR. She works in the capital but she does go to Punta Cana. Her name is Indira Sanchez - her email is\u00a0<span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">indiramua@gmail.com<\/span><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">and her facebook page is:\u00a0<\/span><a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/indiramua<\/a><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365344113297_958\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1365344113297_956\"  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> She was a bit out of my budget. She quoted me $200 for my make up and $100\/each for my bridesmaids. Hair was $75\/per person. I would have also had to pay my vendor fee of $150 for her to come in the resort. So I'm just sticking with the spa. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ejm.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.15.209.120","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315616972,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245130.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EJM17","Id":245130,"Name":"EJM17","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"71800","Title":"Help! I need a professional Makeup\/ Hair artist for Wedding  in Punta Cana!!!","LastPostDate":1424825062},"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
