" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279690-minichic\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MiniChic<\/span><\/a> Did you find any Chic brides? \u00a0I will be visiting this resort in June!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171995300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"167.74.128.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78441,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23a72af602fb39af4c230c6b89aea791","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Tlseege\" post=\"1885823\" timestamp=\"1423581149\"]\n@[member=\"MiniChic\"] Did you find any Chic brides?  I will be visiting this resort in June![\/quote]No, not yet.  I&#039;m getting married there next month!  :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1886082,"PostDate":1423666756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Tlseege, on 10 February 2015 - 11:12 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279690\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279690-minichic\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MiniChic<\/span><\/a> Did you find any Chic brides? \u00a0I will be visiting this resort in June!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>No, not yet. \u00a0I'm getting married there next month!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melaniesirois@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"156.34.44.63","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409852218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279690.jpg?_r=1417629303","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MiniChic","Id":279690,"Name":"MiniChic","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78441","Title":"Chic Punta Cana By Royalton","LastPostDate":1423666756},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
