{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc600c8cc86afe7ccc230e6bbf7d5f2e","RawContent":"I guess if you are superstitious. But your spouse tried that ring on before he bought it and probably when it arrived after ordering it, sooo he&#039;s had it on already :) opposite hand works too. We were actually legally married before Mexico so technically he could have been wearing it anyways lol. It didn&#039;t take away from our day whatsoever. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887466,"PostDate":1424854002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I guess if you are superstitious. But your spouse tried that ring on before he bought it and probably when it arrived after ordering it, sooo he's had it on already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> opposite hand works too. We were actually legally married before Mexico so technically he could have been wearing it anyways lol. It didn't take away from our day whatsoever. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.252.65.94","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a58ccbcfee3484e624562dd36b55739","RawContent":"I guess I&#039;m in the minority but for me I want the wow moment of seeing us wearing rings for the first time after the ceremony.","Attachments":[],"Id":1887467,"PostDate":1424854139,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I guess I'm in the minority but for me I want the wow moment of seeing us wearing rings for the first time after the ceremony. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406718672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1424854881,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7368acbe121182b71fb99d76f244c61d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"nadiakat17\" post=\"1887467\" timestamp=\"1424872139\"]\nI guess I&#039;m in the minority but for me I want the wow moment of seeing us wearing rings for the first time after the ceremony.[\/quote]We didn&#039;t wear ours on the plane but hubby wore his around once in awhile as he decided it was too small and ordered a larger size. That said, it didn&#039;t take away from the day whatsoever. The same as us legally marrying here first didn&#039;t take away from out symbolic in Mexico whatsoever.  For us it&#039;s more the &#039;omg I can call you husband or wife now&#039; or &#039;omg I just changed my name&#039; But everyone is different. \n\nIt&#039;s odd forcing myself to sign my new name. I&#039;m a nurse and sign it a lot and I have been 50\/50. Hahah have to create a new habit now :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887469,"PostDate":1424854788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>nadiakat17, on 25 February 2015 - 08:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nI guess I'm in the minority but for me I want the wow moment of seeing us wearing rings for the first time after the ceremony.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWe didn't wear ours on the plane but hubby wore his around once in awhile as he decided it was too small and ordered a larger size. That said, it didn't take away from the day whatsoever. The same as us legally marrying here first didn't take away from out symbolic in Mexico whatsoever.  For us it's more the 'omg I can call you husband or wife now' or 'omg I just changed my name' But everyone is different. <br><br>\nIt's odd forcing myself to sign my new name. I'm a nurse and sign it a lot and I have been 50\/50. Hahah have to create a new habit now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"939d24e048d87319261b6b2316d93787","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great post @[member=\"LisaAnthonyPoppy\"]!&amp;nbsp; I hadn&#039;t thought about this yet.   I always wear my jewelry when traveling as well but have a feeling the Mr. won&#039;t agree with wearing our wedding rings on the plane.   I&#039;m going to have to do some thinking!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887470,"PostDate":1424855080,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great post @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278120\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a>!\u00a0 I hadn't thought about this yet.\u00a0\u00a0 I always wear my jewelry when traveling as well but have a feeling the Mr. won't agree with wearing our wedding rings on the plane.\u00a0\u00a0 I'm going to have to do some thinking!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candice.french@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.62.169.169","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415103095,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280992.jpg?_r=1421507914","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissFrench","Id":280992,"Name":"MissFrench","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ff2b201d8243e5cfe97904663ec91a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just a thought... what about wearing them around your neck ?? Still close to you but still not around your fingers. @&lt;a  class=\"bbc_member\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;LisaAnthonyPoppy&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887471,"PostDate":1424857375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just a thought... what about wearing them around your neck ?? Still close to you but still not around your fingers. @<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422614988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fc469ea77b31eaf95dbaeede0c377f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t never even thought about this and I&#039;ve also never heard of anything being stolen because they are under huge supervision too.&amp;nbsp; Like there are cameras everywhere.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m sure they would risk losing theirs etc etc..but anyway, I&#039;m sure just about anything is possible.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think the FI and I are def. going to be wearing those puppies as I&#039;m not in the mood to even risk losing the money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887472,"PostDate":1424858657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I haven't never even thought about this and I've also never heard of anything being stolen because they are under huge supervision too.\u00a0 Like there are cameras everywhere.\u00a0 I'm sure they would risk losing theirs etc etc..but anyway, I'm sure just about anything is possible.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think the FI and I are def. going to be wearing those puppies as I'm not in the mood to even risk losing the money.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1435850174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"724f93a0a75dca012c470cc479e6c6d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;LisaAnthonyPoppy&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Knock on wood and never say never, but I have traveled quite a bit and I have never had this happen to me nor have I heard of it happening to anyone else.&amp;nbsp;Of course,&amp;nbsp;I always keep an eye on&amp;nbsp;my belongings at all times, even when going through security screenings. I have been randomly searched from time to time and have never even been asked to step away from my bags. Quite frankly, if someone were to ask&amp;nbsp;me to step away from my bags for any reason (without at least leaving my fianc\u00e9 to watch them) I would refuse. I often travel with valuables, so I don&#039;t mess around when it comes to watching my stuff.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One suggestion&amp;nbsp;I have is to&amp;nbsp;carry the rings in something more&amp;nbsp;inconspicuous than a ring box. At least that way if someone does&amp;nbsp;have to search your bags&amp;nbsp;they&#039;re&amp;nbsp;not sticking out like a sore thumb and no one would even know you&#039;re traveling with them.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887473,"PostDate":1424858801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278120-lisaanthonypoppy\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>LisaAnthonyPoppy<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- Knock on wood and never say never, but I have traveled quite a bit and I have never had this happen to me nor have I heard of it happening to anyone else.\u00a0Of course,\u00a0I always keep an eye on\u00a0my belongings at all times, even when going through security screenings. I have been randomly searched from time to time and have never even been asked to step away from my bags. Quite frankly, if someone were to ask\u00a0me to step away from my bags for any reason (without at least leaving my fianc\u00e9 to watch them) I would refuse. I often travel with valuables, so I don't mess around when it comes to watching my stuff.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>One suggestion\u00a0I have is to\u00a0carry the rings in something more\u00a0inconspicuous than a ring box. At least that way if someone does\u00a0have to search your bags\u00a0they're\u00a0not sticking out like a sore thumb and no one would even know you're traveling with them.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402408389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.14.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d057471dd408596b31946b8385a296b7","RawContent":"Good idea about the necklace! I may give that one some serious thought!\n\n\nThanks for the idea!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887475,"PostDate":1424859063,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Good idea about the necklace! I may give that one some serious thought!<br><br>\nThanks for the idea!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401118433,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.86.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fca28b78e91cec19bd737ac94190601c","RawContent":"@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] haha my fianc\u00e9 wore it around the house for a minute but it didn&#039;t really bother me, guess I am just weird but then again I&#039;m not personally worried about losing them I&#039;m way more worried about forgetting to pack them!! But ring on a string is good","Attachments":[],"Id":1887486,"PostDate":1424865679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> haha my fianc\u00e9 wore it around the house for a minute but it didn't really bother me, guess I am just weird but then again I'm not personally worried about losing them I'm way more worried about forgetting to pack them!! But ring on a string is good \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406718672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78840,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a72923ebf5bdbc8091b613fc2e3ab92","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We travelled to Jamaica with ours but I put them in my purse, not the carryon. I wanted them close by, and I just put both in the one box. I&#039;m like JenniferH114. I keep an eye on my stuff at all times. If anything that&#039;s one of the questions they ask you when travelling - has your luggage been out of your sight at all so absolutely I watch it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve been to Mexico 4 times and Jamaica and have never had an issue, even with the in-room safe. I have a friend that was in upstate New York and checked out of the hotel leaving her wallet in the safe. She went back about 5 hours later realizing what she had done. The maid was there but my friend just went to the safe, keyed her code, opened it and took out her wallet. It was still there!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know there are lots of horror stories but sometimes I wonder if you hear about them because they don&#039;t happen that often.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887490,"PostDate":1424867158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We travelled to Jamaica with ours but I put them in my purse, not the carryon. I wanted them close by, and I just put both in the one box. I'm like JenniferH114. I keep an eye on my stuff at all times. If anything that's one of the questions they ask you when travelling - has your luggage been out of your sight at all so absolutely I watch it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've been to Mexico 4 times and Jamaica and have never had an issue, even with the in-room safe. I have a friend that was in upstate New York and checked out of the hotel leaving her wallet in the safe. She went back about 5 hours later realizing what she had done. The maid was there but my friend just went to the safe, keyed her code, opened it and took out her wallet. It was still there!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know there are lots of horror stories but sometimes I wonder if you hear about them because they don't happen that often.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
