src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Do I have to tip the wait staff if a gratuity is included in my bill? Do I also have to tip the lady making the cake? When does it end?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> It ends when you say it does. If one of your vendors goes above and beyond and you feel you want to say thanks, go for it. If they don't then don't tip.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cdphotog@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1167417240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207000.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nic Dragomire","Id":207000,"Name":"Nic Dragomire","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":21309,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b3ab909cc2905f49738c9de40a4a131","RawContent":"I know this is an older thread but I&#039;m still curious about the tipping questions - especially at an AI, where you are purchasing a wedding package and aren&#039;t really dealing with hiring your own vendors. Any brides who had their DW at an AI that can share how they handled the tipping?","Attachments":[],"Id":755544,"PostDate":1247330701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know this is an older thread but I'm still curious about the tipping questions - especially at an AI, where you are purchasing a wedding package and aren't really dealing with hiring your own vendors. Any brides who had their DW at an AI that can share how they handled the tipping?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Heather & Eric ~ May 5th, 2011 ~ Beaches Turks & Caicos<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"HOCKEYMOM97@GMAIL.COM","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1246651944,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219069.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hockeymom97","Id":219069,"Name":"hockeymom97","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":21309,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8731483fe81a1a13e49465ca066f26bd","RawContent":"I&#039;ve been wondering the same. Any insight would be wonderful!!","Attachments":[],"Id":756108,"PostDate":1247366446,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've been wondering the same. Any insight would be wonderful!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z4Enm6.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Z4Enm6.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"egsarah@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1231821293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213897.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"egsarah","Id":213897,"Name":"egsarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":21309,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e001ade01f721c27210df0dbbd32c5f9","RawContent":"I&#039;m also curious -- I think though that I would tip the WC or maybe give her a nice gift and then I would tip the waitstaff (somehow? I don&#039;t really want to be orchestrating handing out tips on my wedding day)\n \n And the person that performs the ceremony - if we don&#039;t meet them until minutes before the service, how on earth would we tip him? It&#039;s not like I will be carrying a purse... I suppose the groom could carry cash and such.. \n My god, it&#039;s just more to worry about!!","Attachments":[],"Id":756224,"PostDate":1247403797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm also curious -- I think though that I would tip the WC or maybe give her a nice gift and then I would tip the waitstaff (somehow? I don't really want to be orchestrating handing out tips on my wedding day)<br \/> <br \/> And the person that performs the ceremony - if we don't meet them until minutes before the service, how on earth would we tip him? It's not like I will be carrying a purse... I suppose the groom could carry cash and such.. <br \/> My god, it's just more to worry about!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>*******************************<\/span><br><br><span>-Katie<\/span><br><span>Have you met <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.alice.com\/referral\/13B20150\">Alice<\/a><span>?<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/wOtHeXf\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...eXf\/weight.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"khargraves@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1245869640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218765.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"finzup","Id":218765,"Name":"finzup","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":21309,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcbd8ba77503440fa32e26f4ebae8df2","RawContent":"oops.. double post. Sorry","Attachments":[],"Id":756226,"PostDate":1247403809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    f