{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":10,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":532,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1867134,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1408267379,"LastPoster":{"Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1867134,"PostDate":1408267379,"PostContent":"As an update for my previous post- My new sister in law found out that her due date is incredibly...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398520337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c949b6b168eb6d88164cc7cdafe7907","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;As an update for my previous post- My new sister in law found out that her due date is incredibly close to our wedding in Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Her parents told us last night that they, along with my FI&#039;s grandparents won\u2019t be able to make it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As difficult of a decision to make, my FI didn&#039;t feel right about getting married without his mother and grandmother.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We ended up needing to cancel our wedding reservations, but we are still planning on taking the vacation to Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;I still want to do something in Mexico for our wedding, and want to do a trash the dress session for a wedding photo album (I can&#039;t help but feel that a trash the dress would have incredible symmetry to the situation we are in)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have any good ideas, location tips, references for a trash the dress session in the Riviera Maya Mexico??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867134,"PostDate":1408267379,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>As an update for my previous post- My new sister in law found out that her due date is incredibly close to our wedding in Mexico.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Her parents told us last night that they, along with my FI's grandparents won\u2019t be able to make it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As difficult of a decision to make, my FI didn't feel right about getting married without his mother and grandmother.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We ended up needing to cancel our wedding reservations, but we are still planning on taking the vacation to Mexico.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I still want to do something in Mexico for our wedding, and want to do a trash the dress session for a wedding photo album (I can't help but feel that a trash the dress would have incredible symmetry to the situation we are in)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Does anyone have any good ideas, location tips, references for a trash the dress session in the Riviera Maya Mexico??<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398520337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.14.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee3c42b2695c182f069e707c410d977a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh my gosh I&#039;m so sorry to hear that. So what are you going to do? Have a full wedding at home instead? A trash the dress would be a really fun thing to do. Why don&#039;t you talk to your photographer about it and see what they suggest? Rather than cancelling the photographer completely, you could do a few shots in your dress, then lead into a TTD session.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and keep us posted!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867366,"PostDate":1408291528,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh my gosh I'm so sorry to hear that. So what are you going to do? Have a full wedding at home instead? A trash the dress would be a really fun thing to do. Why don't you talk to your photographer about it and see what they suggest? Rather than cancelling the photographer completely, you could do a few shots in your dress, then lead into a TTD session.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and keep us posted!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.220.24.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4daaee88ef32fd2dcdb726616776c319","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So sorry to hear about all that! Props to you for making it all work for everyone! I have seen some amazing shots in cenotes. Check out del Sol photography they seem to get some amazing shots.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867401,"PostDate":1408315080,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So sorry to hear about all that! Props to you for making it all work for everyone! I have seen some amazing shots in cenotes. Check out del Sol photography they seem to get some amazing shots.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400499942,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.112.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7a75302258ac0120f5617e3886b2f3c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"BusyBee280\"] - Oh my goodness, I am SO sorry to hear that.&amp;nbsp; Are you having your wedding at home now? Your date is so soon in November - did you have people already put down deposits?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you do have to move everything, please yes at least have a TTD. The cenotes look gorgeous - that&#039;s where I want to do mine&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and please keep us updated&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867433,"PostDate":1408356158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277733\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277733-busybee280\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BusyBee280<\/span><\/a> - Oh my goodness, I am SO sorry to hear that.\u00a0 Are you having your wedding at home now? Your date is so soon in November - did you have people already put down deposits?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you do have to move everything, please yes at least have a TTD. The cenotes look gorgeous - that's where I want to do mine<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and please keep us updated<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395591348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c11e9e74f15e803b41783df626c5ce26","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@BetsyBee280 Wow, I can&#039;t even imagine e everything you guys must be feeling right now. But, I\"m glad you&#039;re hanging in there! I think second the suggestions for cenotes and the photos in Tulum also look amazing! the beach is gorgeous and there are some secluded areas where you two can feel more intimate I&#039;m sure. Good luck and enjoy your time together&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867439,"PostDate":1408358612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@BetsyBee280 Wow, I can't even imagine e everything you guys must be feeling right now. But, I\"m glad you're hanging in there! I think second the suggestions for cenotes and the photos in Tulum also look amazing! the beach is gorgeous and there are some secluded areas where you two can feel more intimate I'm sure. Good luck and enjoy your time together<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407333354,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb56130d2de6302e6dae5027dc2f8b00","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;While I can&#039;t offer any advice, I want to commend you on you&#039;r amazing attitude. So sorry this happened to you but you are handling it so well and making the bets of it -good for you! Hope you&#039;r trip is AMAZING!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867625,"PostDate":1408438406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>While I can't offer any advice, I want to commend you on you'r amazing attitude. So sorry this happened to you but you are handling it so well and making the bets of it -good for you! Hope you'r trip is AMAZING!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391602956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc5a1c8eacbb00dcb72cdb8c0e3b7ecf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am so sorry for what you are going thru - it must have been a tough decision and you seem to be handling it very well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cudos to you for doing what your fiance needs in this tough time!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I second you going and doing a trash the dress. Enjoy yourselves. Will this be like a honeymoon? Are you getting married at home beforehand or?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867630,"PostDate":1408442787,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am so sorry for what you are going thru - it must have been a tough decision and you seem to be handling it very well.<\/p>\n<p>Cudos to you for doing what your fiance needs in this tough time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I second you going and doing a trash the dress. Enjoy yourselves. Will this be like a honeymoon? Are you getting married at home beforehand or?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"259be3d69d8258c66f666868d5a33e70","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1867630\" timestamp=\"1408460787\"]\nI am so sorry for what you are going thru - it must have been a tough decision and you seem to be handling it very well.\nCudos to you for doing what your fiance needs in this tough time!\n\nI second you going and doing a trash the dress. Enjoy yourselves. Will this be like a honeymoon? Are you getting married at home beforehand or?\n\nGood luck![\/quote]\nWe are just going to continue with the trip- my side of the family will be attending, while most of his wont. We plan to enjoy the first portion of the trip with family, then we are going to Cosumel for our honeymoon portion.\n\n[quote name=\"tygrrlily\" post=\"1867433\" timestamp=\"1408374158\"]\n@[member=\"BusyBee280\"] - Oh my goodness, I am SO sorry to hear that.  Are you having your wedding at home now? Your date is so soon in November - did you have people already put down deposits?\n\nIf you do have to move everything, please yes at least have a TTD. The cenotes look gorgeous - that&#039;s where I want to do mine\n\nGood luck and please keep us updated[\/quote]\nWe are planning a SMALL wedding at home now- our date is October 11th and it will be family only. We have already put deposits on everything, but the cancellation\n[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1867366\" timestamp=\"1408309528\"]\nOh my gosh I&#039;m so sorry to hear that. So what are you going to do? Have a full wedding at home instead? A trash the dress would be a really fun thing to do. Why don&#039;t you talk to your photographer about it and see what they suggest? Rather than cancelling the photographer completely, you could do a few shots in your dress, then lead into a TTD session.\n\nGood luck and keep us posted![\/quote] I like the idea! I do want a few shots in the dress before I go into the water. We are planning a small wedding at home, and bringing everyone out for dinner. We are keeping the dinner reservations in Mexico for anyone who wants to join, and we are planning the \"trash the dress\" too. I&#039;m still unsure of how to go about getting out there etc. My dad wants us to buy a camera that we can take the pictures ourselves.\npolicy states that we can use the money towards extras on our room bill.","Attachments":[],"Id":1867885,"PostDate":1408552209,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 19 August 2014 - 10:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am so sorry for what you are going thru - it must have been a tough decision and you seem to be handling it very well.<\/p>\n<p>Cudos to you for doing what your fiance needs in this tough time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I second you going and doing a trash the dress. Enjoy yourselves. Will this be like a honeymoon? Are you getting married at home beforehand or?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are just going to continue with the trip- my side of the family will be attending, while most of his wont. We plan to enjoy the first portion of the trip with family, then we are going to Cosumel for our honeymoon portion.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tygrrlily, on 18 August 2014 - 10:02 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277733\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277733-busybee280\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BusyBee280<\/span><\/a> - Oh my goodness, I am SO sorry to hear that.\u00a0 Are you having your wedding at home now? Your date is so soon in November - did you have people already put down deposits?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you do have to move everything, please yes at least have a TTD. The cenotes look gorgeous - that's where I want to do mine<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and please keep us updated<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning a SMALL wedding at home now- our date is October 11th and it will be family only. We have already put deposits on everything, but the cancellation<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 17 August 2014 - 04:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh my gosh I'm so sorry to hear that. So what are you going to do? Have a full wedding at home instead? A trash the dress would be a really fun thing to do. Why don't you talk to your photographer about it and see what they suggest? Rather than cancelling the photographer completely, you could do a few shots in your dress, then lead into a TTD session.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and keep us posted!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0I like the idea! I do want a few shots in the dress before I go into the water. We are planning a small wedding at home, and bringing everyone out for dinner. We are keeping the dinner reservations in Mexico for anyone who wants to join, and we are planning the \"trash the dress\" too. I'm still unsure of how to go about getting out there etc. My dad wants us to buy a camera that we can take the pictures ourselves.<\/p>\n<p>policy states that we can use the money towards extras on our room bill.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.hodges1@snhu.edu","IpAddress":"24.62.217.165","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398520337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277733.jpg?_r=1400873765","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BusyBee280","Id":277733,"Name":"BusyBee280","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.110.21.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"15e30d298bc1b05c48841446206c643f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sarani from Sarani Photography does amazing TTD sessions. &amp;nbsp;Check out her work because she will not let you down.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868893,"PostDate":1408992644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sarani from Sarani Photography does amazing TTD sessions. \u00a0Check out her work because she will not let you down.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicki7985@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"96.235.184.26","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405883052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279097.jpg?_r=1408764462","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NickiLynn1116","Id":279097,"Name":"NickiLynn1116","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.109.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77838,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79cfaece061894795cd5805fe9b27db0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jsparrow10\" post=\"1867401\" timestamp=\"1408333080\"]\nSo sorry to hear about all that! Props to you for making it all work for everyone! I have seen some amazing shots in cenotes. Check out del Sol photography they seem to get some amazing shots.[\/quote]\nThanks @[member=\"jsparrow10\"] we really appreciate the shout out!\n\n \n[quote name=\"BusyBee280\" post=\"1867134\" timestamp=\"1408285379\"]\nAs an update for my previous post- My new sister in law found out that her due date is incredibly close to our wedding in Mexico.\n\nHer parents told us last night that they, along with my FI&#039;s grandparents won\u2019t be able to make it.\n\nAs difficult of a decision to make, my FI didn&#039;t feel right about getting married without his mother and grandmother.\n\nWe ended up needing to cancel our wedding reservations, but we are still planning on taking the vacation to Mexico.\n\n I still want to do something in Mexico for our wedding, and want to do a trash the dress session for a wedding photo album (I can&#039;t help but feel that a trash the dress would have incredible symmetry to the situation we are in)\n\nDoes anyone have any good ideas, location tips, references for a trash the dress session in the Riviera Maya Mexico??[\/quote]\n@[member=\"BusyBee280\"] We would love to convert you to a mermaid bride! Here are a few of our [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/category\/trash-the-dress\/\"]trash the dress images[\/url]. Please contact us at info@delsolphotography.com and we&#039;ll be happy to help!\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74400-trash-the-dress\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_184723.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74401-trash-the-dress\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_56335.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74402-trash-the-dress\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_98056.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74404-trash-the-dress\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_65091.jpg[\/img][\/url]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74409-trash-the-dress\/\"][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_37604.jpg[\/img][\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1871146,"PostDate":1410264193,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jsparrow10, on 17 August 2014 - 10:38 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><div><p>So sorry to hear about all that! Props to you for making it all work for everyone! I have seen some amazing shots in cenotes. Check out del Sol photography they seem to get some amazing shots.\u00a0<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278025\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278025-jsparrow10\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jsparrow10<\/span><\/a> we really appreciate the shout out!<br><br>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BusyBee280, on 17 August 2014 - 09:22 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><div><p>As an update for my previous post- My new sister in law found out that her due date is incredibly close to our wedding in Mexico.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Her parents told us last night that they, along with my FI's grandparents won\u2019t be able to make it.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>As difficult of a decision to make, my FI didn't feel right about getting married without his mother and grandmother.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>We ended up needing to cancel our wedding reservations, but we are still planning on taking the vacation to Mexico.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0I still want to do something in Mexico for our wedding, and want to do a trash the dress session for a wedding photo album (I can't help but feel that a trash the dress would have incredible symmetry to the situation we are in)<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Does anyone have any good ideas, location tips, references for a trash the dress session in the Riviera Maya Mexico??<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277733\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277733-busybee280\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">BusyBee280<\/span><\/a> We would love to convert you to a mermaid bride! Here are a few of our <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/category\/trash-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>trash the dress images<\/a>. Please contact us at info@delsolphotography.com and we'll be happy to help!<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74400-trash-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_184723.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17602_184723.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74401-trash-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_56335.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17602_56335.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74402-trash-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_98056.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17602_98056.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74404-trash-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_65091.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17602_65091.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/74409-trash-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17602\/gallery_207303_17602_37604.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_207303_17602_37604.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175001240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77838","Title":"Family Cant Come Due To Pregnancy- Trash The Dress?","LastPostDate":1410264193},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
